Output demo/recordings/podcasts.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Set Theme "Ayu Mirage"

Hide
Type "./waxon-demo demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

# Podcasts, under Albums · Artists · Podcasts in the Library
Type "j"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "jjj"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "jj"
Sleep 1.5s
